We built this library because agent harnesses were too fragmented and we needed a simple abstraction to call multiple coding-agent SDKs.<p>lite-harness has one function - query()<p>import { query } from &quot;@lite-harness&#x2F;sdk&quot;;<p>for await (const message of query({
  prompt: &quot;Fix the failing test&quot;,
  options: {
    &#x2F;&#x2F; swap harness between: &quot;claude-agent&quot;, &quot;openai-agents&quot;, &quot;pi-ai&quot;
    harness: &quot;openai-agents&quot;,
    model: &quot;gpt-5.5&quot;,
  },
})) {
  console.log(message);
}
